  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the grimy alleys of Street Brokeland, Glitch has seen more than his fair share of scrap metal and broken dreams. After a nasty run-in with a faulty Drip recycler, his eyes were replaced with scavenged AI optics, giving him a digitized perspective on the wasteland that few others possess.",
